## Rule 4 — Skip the Flawless Premium ($861 for a Microscope Line)

The jump from VVS1 to IF or FL on 1.5ct lab costs **$861**. The visible difference is zero. The clarity grade is a loupe or microscope distinction, not a naked-eye distinction. On a 12 × 6 mm face-up stone, VVS1 inclusions are already impossible to find without magnification.

